# Copy to .env.local for local development. Values are NOT committed.
#
# Local dev points at the TEST project (vswuurrtbzbrgubddefv). Production is
# configured on Vercel — Settings → Environment Variables — and never in a
# file, so a checked-out file can never decide which database live users hit.
# The anon key is public by design (it ships in the app bundle); it is kept
# out of git anyway so the TWO projects can never be confused by a stray file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
